Fontconfig and Windows fonts

Install:
  Install fontconfig and copy missing Windows fonts; refresh the font cache.

Upgrade:
  Update installed fontconfig and existing Windows font copies; refresh the font cache.

Status:
  Report fontconfig and the number of copied font files.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: /mnt/c/Windows/Fonts
  Destination: ~/.local/share/fonts/windows
